From a9106c7ae86b09811a3658e8757ef6288d72d21f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JuanLiz <47019693+JuanLiz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:19:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] wifi: 1.0-legacy: build with Android.mk on Android 13

libwifi-hal is still a Make module in 13, so the Soong module from the
1.6 bump cannot depend on it. Keep the original Android.mk with the new
sources, HAL versions and libxml2.
---
 wifi/1.0-legacy/Android.bp | 182 -------------------------------------
 wifi/1.0-legacy/Android.mk | 152 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 152 insertions(+), 182 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 wifi/1.0-legacy/Android.bp
 create mode 100644 wifi/1.0-legacy/Android.mk

